// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// Part 3's egg sacs, hatching when disturbed, the prize among them: reuses
// `props.ron`'s own "egg sac" (health 1, `Hatch` on being destroyed) rather
// than a second kind.
(
    name: "The Brood Chamber",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "e.e",
        ".P.",
        "e.e",
    ],
    legend: {
        '.': Tile("hall floor"),
        'e': Prop("egg sac"),
        'P': Item(tag: "staff", count: 1),
    },
)
